WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.960
Priya: Okay, let's reassign the task for evidence cleanup. Raj can help while approval is pending.
好，重新分配证据整理任务。等批准期间Raj可以帮忙。

2
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:14.329
Lukas: Which task moves, and who accepts it? Avoid leaving test ownership unclear after reassignment.
哪项任务转移，谁接受？不能重分配后让测试责任不清。

3
00:00:14.329 --> 00:00:21.649
Raj: I'm on it for rotation evidence cleanup. Hannah still owns test acceptance and coverage.
轮转证据整理我来做，Hannah仍负责测试验收和覆盖。

4
00:00:21.649 --> 00:00:29.666
Hannah: Accepted, that gives me bandwidth for assertions. My driver tests remain pending the image.
接受，这样我有精力补断言。驱动测试仍等待镜像。

5
00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:35.666
Anika: I'll keep the service limit report today. It doesn't depend on that new image.
今天我继续做服务上限报告，它不依赖新镜像。

6
00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:43.466
Priya: Just to confirm, no added production scope, right? Each action item keeps its original boundary.
我确认一下，不新增生产范围，对吧？各项待办保持原边界。

7
00:00:43.466 --> 00:00:50.139
Lukas: Right, I still review rotation at two. Put the updated evidence beside the request.
对，我仍两点评审轮转，把更新证据附在请求旁。

8
00:00:50.139 --> 00:00:57.291
Raj: That takes roughly an hour after follow-up. I'll note any missing evidence rather than guessing.
跟进后整理大约一小时，缺证据就注明，不猜测。

9
00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:04.828
Hannah: Can we take it offline for assertion details? The standup only needs the changed ownership.
断言细节会后聊好吗？站会只需要知道责任变化。

10
00:01:04.828 --> 00:01:11.500
Priya: So, agreed, pair after this meeting. No new deadline for the blocked rollout today.
同意，会后结对。今天不给受阻上线新增截止时间。

